      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.19,
          "end": 3.87,
          "en": "The goal now is to generate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.87,
          "end": 6.12,
          "en": "these AnswerButtons here dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.12,
          "end": 8.79,
          "en": "based on the actual amount of answers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.79,
          "end": 12.12,
          "en": "that we have for the current question.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.12,
          "end": 14.64,
          "en": "And by the way, later we will of course also make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.64,
          "end": 18.3,
          "en": "that the question changes once it has been answered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.3,
          "end": 19.133,
          "en": "But for the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.133,
          "end": 22.5,
          "en": "we just wanna output these AnswerButtons dynamically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.5,
          "end": 26.85,
          "en": "And this can be done by going to our children list here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.85,
          "end": 28.26,
          "en": "in this column,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.26,
          "end": 30.36,
          "en": "and then in there we can access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.36,
          "end": 35.36,
          "en": "currentQuestion.answers, which is this list of strings.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.82,
          "end": 40.38,
          "en": "And now we must convert these strings to widgets, so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.38,
          "end": 43.74,
          "en": "to widgets that then use these strings.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.74,
          "end": 45.99,
          "en": "And such a conversion can be done",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.99,
          "end": 49.75,
          "en": "by using Dart's built-in map method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.75,
          "end": 51.03,
          "en": "Now for that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.03,
          "end": 54.18,
          "en": "it's important to understand that answers is a list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.18,
          "end": 56.46,
          "en": "it's a list of strings.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.46,
          "end": 60.36,
          "en": "And lists no matter which kind of values they contain,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.36,
          "end": 64.11,
          "en": "but lists in general in Dart have a broad variety",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.11,
          "end": 65.85,
          "en": "of built-in methods,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.85,
          "end": 69.93,
          "en": "built-in functions that can be called on them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.93,
          "end": 71.94,
          "en": "And these functions simply interact",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.94,
          "end": 74.07,
          "en": "with the list in different ways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.07,
          "end": 75,
          "en": "For example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75,
          "end": 78.66,
          "en": "add would allow you to add a new item to that list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.66,
          "end": 81.78,
          "en": "Something we'll also use later in the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.78,
          "end": 86.46000000000001,
          "en": "Map allows you to convert, to transform you could say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.46000000000001,
          "end": 90.26,
          "en": "the values in a list to other values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.26,
          "end": 94.2,
          "en": "For that map takes a function as a value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.2,
          "end": 96.63,
          "en": "so that's another example for a place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.63,
          "end": 99.57,
          "en": "where a function is used as a value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.57,
          "end": 102.87,
          "en": "and this function which you pass to map",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 102.87,
          "end": 105.96000000000001,
          "en": "will be executed automatically by Dart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 105.96000000000001,
          "end": 108.87,
          "en": "for every list item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.87,
          "end": 112.05,
          "en": "So Dart automatically goes through the entire list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.05,
          "end": 115.713,
          "en": "and executes this function on every list item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 116.97,
          "end": 120.93,
          "en": "Now Dart will then also automatically pass the list item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 120.93,
          "end": 123.81,
          "en": "for which it is currently executing this function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.81,
          "end": 126.54,
          "en": "as argument to this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.54,
          "end": 128.13,
          "en": "So here you get the list item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.13,
          "end": 131.315,
          "en": "for which this function is currently being executed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 131.315,
          "end": 133.659,
          "en": "and inside of the function body",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 133.659,
          "end": 137.91,
          "en": "you then can return the transformed item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 137.91,
          "end": 141.06,
          "en": "So the new value you wanna have in the list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.06,
          "end": 143.16,
          "en": "instead of that old item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 143.16,
          "end": 147.06,
          "en": "And of course, that new value which you return here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 147.06,
          "end": 150.39,
          "en": "can and typically will be based on this item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.39,
          "end": 152.16,
          "en": "on which the function was called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 152.16,
          "end": 154.89,
          "en": "and which you receive as an argument here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 154.89,
          "end": 156.36,
          "en": "because that then allows you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 156.36,
          "end": 160.62,
          "en": "to basically replace all the items in a list with new items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 160.62,
          "end": 163.07999999999998,
          "en": "that are based on the old items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 163.07999999999998,
          "end": 166.51,
          "en": "And here I wanna return my AnswerButton widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.82,
          "end": 170.76,
          "en": "so that I convert this list of answers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 170.76,
          "end": 175.14,
          "en": "this list of strings to a list of AnswerButtons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 175.14,
          "end": 177.99,
          "en": "And since widgets are in the end just objects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 177.99,
          "end": 181.41,
          "en": "which are totally normal values in Dart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 181.41,
          "end": 184.56,
          "en": "it's absolutely fine to convert a list of strings",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 184.56,
          "end": 186.09,
          "en": "to a list of widgets,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 186.09,
          "end": 188.343,
          "en": "even though it might sound strange at first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 189.45,
          "end": 190.92,
          "en": "Now, it's important to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 190.92,
          "end": 195.92,
          "en": "that this conversion does not change the original list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 196.23,
          "end": 198.3,
          "en": "So the list of answers that is stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 198.3,
          "end": 200.43,
          "en": "in these quiz question objects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 200.43,
          "end": 204.06,
          "en": "does not change when calling map here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.06,
          "end": 207.3,
          "en": "Instead, map in the end yields a new list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 207.3,
          "end": 210.24,
          "en": "a brand new list object in memory,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 210.24,
          "end": 213.36,
          "en": "but both lists coexist in memory.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 213.36,
          "end": 215.13,
          "en": "That's really important to understand.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.13,
          "end": 218.19,
          "en": "Map does not change the original list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 218.19,
          "end": 222.39,
          "en": "instead it returns a new list full of new objects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 222.39,
          "end": 224.85,
          "en": "In this case, full of new AnswerButtons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 224.85,
          "end": 226.32,
          "en": "And on these AnswerButtons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 226.32,
          "end": 230.55,
          "en": "we can of course then set answerText to item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 230.55,
          "end": 233.43,
          "en": "because item here will be of type string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 233.43,
          "end": 237.87,
          "en": "since our answers are strings in that list of strings.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 237.87,
          "end": 239.67000000000002,
          "en": "So item is our string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 239.67000000000002,
          "end": 241.89,
          "en": "We could also name it answer instead of item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 241.89,
          "end": 244.41,
          "en": "because that name is up to you to make it clearer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 244.41,
          "end": 246.81,
          "en": "that we'll get the individual answers here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 246.81,
          "end": 248.61,
          "en": "since this function is executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 248.61,
          "end": 251.79,
          "en": "for all the answers automatically by Dart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 251.79,
          "end": 255.12,
          "en": "and hence, we can set this answer string as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 255.12,
          "end": 257.373,
          "en": "for the answerText which wants a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 258.48,
          "end": 261.63,
          "en": "And for onTap, we can for the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 261.63,
          "end": 264.003,
          "en": "just pass an empty anonymous function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 266.64,
          "end": 268.74,
          "en": "But now you see I'm getting an error here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 268.74,
          "end": 272.4,
          "en": "and in the end I'm getting an error here that this element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 272.4,
          "end": 276.03,
          "en": "which is of type, iterable, whatever that may be,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 276.03,
