          "en": "can't be assigned to the list type widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 279.36,
          "end": 281.90999999999997,
          "en": "The problem which we in the end have here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 281.90999999999997,
          "end": 285.39,
          "en": "is that I now got a list of AnswerButtons",
