        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 295.77,
          "end": 297.72,
          "en": "or an iterable here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 297.72,
          "end": 299.49,
          "en": "And that would also be the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 299.49,
          "end": 301.62,
          "en": "if I manually create a list here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 301.62,
          "end": 304.11,
          "en": "a list of AnswerButtons for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 304.11,
          "end": 306.33,
          "en": "Here, I also would be getting an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 306.33,
          "end": 309.959,
          "en": "that this type of data is not wanted here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 309.959,
          "end": 314.34,
          "en": "And it's not wanted here because children, this argument,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 314.34,
          "end": 318.179,
          "en": "which we set on the column here, wants a list of widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 318.179,
          "end": 322.26,
          "en": "Now here inside of that list that we are creating,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 322.26,
          "end": 326.159,
          "en": "we are creating another list though, a nested list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 326.159,
          "end": 329.04,
          "en": "So now children is a list of widgets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 329.04,
          "end": 331.14,
          "en": "like text and size box,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 331.14,
          "end": 335.13,
          "en": "but also a list that contains other lists as values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 335.13,
          "end": 337.32,
          "en": "and that's simply not what children wants.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 337.32,
          "end": 341.22,
          "en": "It wants just widgets as values inside this list,",
